rc=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/90/60/8a/fc59c15f15dd13017247ef4894c6cf28.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMỗi món đồ đều được thiết kế tỷ mỉ, đảm bảo an toàn và phát huy tối đa tác dụng trong quãng thời gian ngắn ngủi khi trẻ 1-3 tuổi\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cspan class=\"_5mfr\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"_6qdm\"\u003e️\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Size: 30 x 40 cm\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cspan class=\"_5mfr\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"_6qdm\"\u003e️\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Gồm nhiều đồ chơi ở cả hai mặt\u003cspan class=\"_5mfr\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"_6qdm\"\u003e️\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Chất liệu: Gỗ an toàn, không mối mọt, không mốc\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cspan class=\"_5mfr\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"_6qdm\"\u003e️\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Các chi tiết được sơn màu màu vẽ acrylic an toàn\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cspan class=\"_5mfr\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"_6qdm\"\u003e️\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Bảng bận rộn busy board, sensory board nay đã có hộp carton đẹp, lịch sự như hộp quà.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/9e/a8/9c/7dcc3f3dc96bde30ce592cf3679af582.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/9e/a8/9c/7dcc3f3dc96bde30ce592cf3679af582.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/68/5d/89/ae95beeba285137e0a03591636d463ee.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/68/5d/89/ae95beeba285137e0a03591636d463ee.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGiá sản phẩm trên Tiki đã bao gồm thuế theo luật hiện hành. Bên cạnh đó, tuỳ vào loại sản phẩm, hình thức và địa chỉ giao hàng mà có thể phát sinh thêm chi phí khác như phí vận chuyển, phụ phí hàng cồng kềnh, thuế nhập khẩu (đối với đơn hàng giao từ nước ngoài có giá trị trên 1 triệu đồng).....\u003c/p\u003e","images":[{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/2d/5e/5b/3756f3d18e166bea6754a1b8a8fd1fde.png","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/2d/5e/5b/3756f3d18e166bea6754a1b8a8fd1fde.png","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/2d/5e/5b/3756f3d18e166bea6754a1b8a8fd1fde.png","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/2d/5e/5b/3756f3d18e166bea6754a1b8a8fd1fde.png","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/2d/5e/5b/3756f3d18e166bea6754a1b8a8fd1fde.png"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/a2/87/be/5f21e06d29253896cc07526735bfcd83.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/a2/87/be/5f21e06d29253896cc07526735bfcd83.jpg","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/a2/87/be/5f21e06d29253896cc07526735bfcd83.jpg","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/a2/87/be/5f21e06d29253896cc07526735bfcd83.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/a2/87/be/5f21e06d29253896cc07526735bfcd83.jpg"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/6f/71/82/a9c2d0b41b0a3f60c2169cd57b43ba6c.png","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/6f/71/82/a9c2d0b41b0a3f60c2169cd57b43ba6c.png","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/6f/71/82/a9c2d0b41b0a3f60c2169cd57b43ba6c.png","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/6f/71/82/a9c2d0b41b0a3f60c2169cd57b43ba6c.png","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/6f/71/82/a9c2d0b41b0a3f60c2169cd57b43ba6c.png"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/ed/2b/7b/91d7e3ce68fbb4fc96ce7b05e0bd4bb9.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.